{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A dealer bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> radios for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> a positive integer.  He contributed two radios to a community bazaar at half their cost.  The rest he sold at a profit of &#36;8 on each radio sold.  If the overall profit was &#36;72, then the least possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for the given information is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/3/c1305c784d56f8960c41defd98a2a0e8e682bc41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 18\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 16\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 15\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 12\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"393\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> radios are sold for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/4/0049275faba66d1146c7cab42dc026f0b71cee89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> dollars each, for income of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/5/4f57664ea70f925f8d264373e8c2715573d27e87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot \\frac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"33\" height=\"37\" />, or simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The remaining <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/9/ef9b02e32cfba0db0f9038a8d077596720f62e91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> radios are sold for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/3/463c571073c1b24f86f589615ca125f7a4dc0e71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d+8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> dollars each, for income of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/b/21bd208a6bccf0e7d73d49a704fbf663b175c79a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n-2)(d+8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />, which expands to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c14d021f99ca65bf2ce935a86af49a740425481.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$nd +8n -2d - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The amount invested in buying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> radios for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d18fe37d0a4ef803d3c18da7382c157b40696f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$nd$\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the total profit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/9/389cb6b3571958382159da3123c722b2fdf02c5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(d) + (nd - 2d + 8n - 16) - nd$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"246\" height=\"18\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/7/dd71a3b0f80f39d6d0f017a2993ee49412a68bd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8n - d - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"91\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Setting this equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f6f531bd524fc1cd57dec5b52f77c9e3503b685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8n - d - 16 = 72$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"134\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bdab605d625e0c6ae4d0020d066aa8c639a4b1df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 11 + \\frac{d}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"87\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be an integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> must be a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  If we want to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, we want to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da8ee2c7901d9e6d7369fcf97a7ab6b61ce6082.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0244498787c4d844800b9f291b9a37dda72ab9d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=8$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be185b7073ad0f180c628cc203f28e9bd941df65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, giving the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/25809e4f87f20a2ee949878bc603b9eda09422ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">Problem 29</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">Problem 31</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit